# Immutable Kafka dependency and upstream attribution evidence

2026-11-05. Inert source/legal text only. No build, Maven, Gradle, compiler,
Java, codec or image execution. All files below are under `kafka-admission/`.
The original image inventory and wrong protobuf notice remain unchanged.

Browser cache misses and sandbox DNS failures were followed by authorized bounded
curl reads: HTTPS only, TLS>=1.2, no redirect option, no credentials/auth headers,
connect10s, total20s, individual maximum1MiB. All successful commands exited0;
their178737B total is below1MiB. No response-header/status artifact was captured,
so success is command exit evidence, not a retained HTTP transcript. The attempted
OTel tag `v1.3.2-alpha` returned404; the actual tag is `v1.3.2`. Tag discovery is
not immutable; the retained tag object then anchors the exact commit for source
and license reads. Both upstream annotated tags report unsigned verification.

